WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.048 --> 00:00:05.985
The campers were in the assembly hall for evening program.

2
00:00:05.986 --> 00:00:10.219
They sat in a circle while Penelope led them in a song.

3
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:17.459
"I love the mountains. I love the rolling hills," everyone sang.

4
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:21.972
Ivy poked Glen and pointed at the Ucks across the circle.

5
00:00:21.973 --> 00:00:24.206
Glen nodded.

6
00:00:24.207 --> 00:00:29.855
"Boom-dee-a-da, boom-dee-ay," Penelope and the others sang.

7
00:00:29.856 --> 00:00:33.969
Glen crouched down and crept over to the Ucks.

8
00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:37.139
"I still have some candy," he whispered.

9
00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:42.164
"Come to the square after evening program if you want some."

10
00:00:42.165 --> 00:00:44.754
The Ucks nodded.

11
00:00:44.755 --> 00:00:49.482
Glen scooted back to his spot and smiled at Ivy.

12
00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:55.071
When the song ended, Wes Wheezer stood up and blew his bugle.

13
00:00:55.072 --> 00:00:59.498
"Good night, campers, and sweet dreams!" Penelope said.

14
00:00:59.499 --> 00:01:06.528
"Be ready for more Evergreen fun tomorrow!"

15
00:01:06.529 --> 00:01:12.859
Ivy, Glen, and Ezra rushed out the door and went straight to the square.

16
00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.173
"I hope this works," Ezra said.

17
00:01:16.174 --> 00:01:20.537
"It will if the Ucks show up for their candy," Ivy said.

18
00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:25.242
The three kids dropped to the grass and stretched out on their stomachs.

19
00:01:25.243 --> 00:01:31.055
Soon they heard voices and saw flashlights shining.

20
00:01:31.056 --> 00:01:36.197
"They're coming!" Ivy whispered. "Stay down."

21
00:01:36.198 --> 00:01:40.162
In the dark the Ucks couldn't see them.

22
00:01:40.163 --> 00:01:45.521
"Where's Snuggy Wuggy's stupid friend with our candy?" Chuck asked.

23
00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:49.967
"He'll have it, if he knows what's good for him!" Huck said.

24
00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:53.951
Across the square, Ivy saw something move.

25
00:01:53.952 --> 00:01:57.836
"Look, Mango and Larry are coming!"

26
00:01:57.837 --> 00:02:00.703
Three dark shadows approached.

27
00:02:00.704 --> 00:02:05.498
Mango was pushing the bear statue on a flatbed cart across the grass.

28
00:02:05.499 --> 00:02:12.125
Larry walked next to the cart, trying to keep the bear from falling off.

29
00:02:12.126 --> 00:02:14.154
The Ucks froze.

30
00:02:14.155 --> 00:02:17.919
"Wh-what's that?" Buck asked.

31
00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:22.338
"Whoa!" Larry said as the statue bounced on the cart.

32
00:02:22.339 --> 00:02:26.844
"Hey, like, be careful, Mango! This thing could break.

33
00:02:26.845 --> 00:02:34.825
And it would be, like, really bad if we broke Mr. Offal's special gift!" The

34
00:02:34.826 --> 00:02:39.884
Ucks shined their flashlights on the statue as it bounced and wobbled. Ivy

35
00:02:39.885 --> 00:02:44.917
grinned. Her plan was working even better than she'd imagined. The

36
00:02:44.918 --> 00:02:49.861
statue looked like a real bear moving through the darkness! "Ahh!

37
00:02:49.862 --> 00:02:53.240
It's a bear!" Chuck shouted. "A

38
00:02:53.241 --> 00:02:57.079
bear! Help!" Buck screamed. The

39
00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.988
Ucks started running. "Who's

40
00:02:59.989 --> 00:03:04.285
there?" Larry sounded confused. From

41
00:03:04.286 --> 00:03:08.945
their hiding spot, Ivy and the boys covered their mouths and laughed. "The

42
00:03:08.946 --> 00:03:13.752
Ucks are so scared!" Ivy whispered. Suddenly

43
00:03:13.753 --> 00:03:17.398
they saw a bright light. Private

44
00:03:17.399 --> 00:03:24.071
ran toward the square carrying a big lantern. "What's all this noise?" Behind

45
00:03:24.072 --> 00:03:29.619
her, more people appeared. Some were wearing pajamas. "Mommy,

46
00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:32.514
save me!" Buck

47
00:03:32.515 --> 00:03:36.200
ran to Private, almost knocking her over. "Calm

48
00:03:36.201 --> 00:03:43.379
down!" Private shouted. "I am not your mommy!" The

49
00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:47.995
campers laughed at Buck, who was shaking all over. "Let's

50
00:03:47.996 --> 00:03:49.881
join the others. They'll

51
00:03:49.882 --> 00:03:53.519
think we just got here," Ivy whispered. She

52
00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:57.719
and the boys slipped into the crowd. "What's

53
00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:02.806
wrong? Was someone screaming about a bear in camp?" Penelope said. "Of

54
00:04:02.807 --> 00:04:09.612
course there's a bear. A bear statue ," Private said.

55
00:04:09.613 --> 00:04:14.739
The crowd watched as Mango moved the statue while Larry held the cart still.

56
00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:19.971
It wobbled as Mango set it down, then finally it stood still.

57
00:04:19.972 --> 00:04:23.476
Mango sighed. "Whew!"

58
00:04:23.477 --> 00:04:30.470
Larry patted Mango's shoulder. "That was, like, great teamwork."

59
00:04:30.471 --> 00:04:38.666
"A statue?" Buck was still shaking his head. "It looked so real!"

60
00:04:38.667 --> 00:04:44.634
"Hey, Buck," Ezra said. "Did you call Private your mommy?"

61
00:04:44.635 --> 00:04:51.047
Everyone laughed. Buck glared at Ezra but kept quiet.

62
00:04:51.048 --> 00:04:56.825
Private blew her whistle. "Time for bed, campers!"

63
00:04:56.826 --> 00:05:00.478
The crowd walked toward the cabins.

64
00:05:00.479 --> 00:05:06.719
"We did it!" Ivy whispered gleefully. "We scared those Ucks!"

65
00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.661
Glen grinned and so did Ezra.

66
00:05:09.662 --> 00:05:23.938
"Great teamwork!" he said with a thumbs-up.

